### 1) List events of organizer 1 (empty at the start -> "No events yet")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizers/1/events

### 2) Upload a picture (choose a real file path on your computer)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/images
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="poster.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\Kaled\OneDrive\Desktop\WhatsApp Image 2025-10-14 at 20.58.57_edd67c50.jpg
--Boundary--

### 3) Create an event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizers/1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Music Festival",
  "imagePath": "/uploads/d77cda51-9dfb-42e2-b89d-631a0b677294.jpg",
  "startDateTime": "2026-12-20T18:00:00",
  "endDateTime": "2026-12-20T23:30:00",
  "about": "A night of live music with local bands.",
  "tickets": [
    { "name": "Regular", "price": 150.00, "capacity": 500 },
    { "name": "VIP", "price":  400.00, "capacity": 50 }
  ],
  "venue": {
    "name": "City Open Theatre",
    "location": "Downtown, Cairo",
    "imagePath": null
  },
  "facilities": ["Parking", "Food court", "WiFi"]
}

### 4) Get one event
GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizers/1/events/1

### 5) Update it (same body shape as create)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/organizers/1/events/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Music Festival 2026",
  "startDateTime": "2026-12-20T19:00:00",
  "endDateTime": "2026-12-21T00:00:00",
  "about": "Updated description.",
  "tickets": [ { "name": "Regular", "price": 175.00, "capacity": 600 } ],
  "venue": { "name": "City Open Theatre", "location": "Downtown, Cairo" },
  "facilities": ["Parking"]
}

### 6) Delete it
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/organizers/1/events/1
